      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "## MLOps Business KPIs\n\nExecutive-level dashboard showing the data flywheel: predictions \u2192 labels \u2192 retraining. Tracks the health of the full MLOps feedback loop over 7-day windows.\n\n### Key Panels\n| Panel | What to look for |\n|:------|:-----------------|\n| Labels Collected (7d) | Injected ground-truth labels in last 7 days via `/inject-label` |\n| Drift Alerts (7d) | Drift detection events in last 7 days (not file count) |\n| Labeled vs Unlabeled | Gap between collected predictions and labelled data \u2014 the feedback loop gap |\n| Retraining Triggers by Reason | `scheduled` vs `drift` vs `manual` \u2014 shows what drives retraining |\n| Model Deploy Time | Time from trigger to production promotion (seconds) |\n| Automation Rate | Fraction of retraining runs triggered automatically |\n| Mean Time to Detect | Average seconds between drift detection events |\n\n**Data sources:** `labels_injected_total`, `drift_detections_total`, `model_predictions_total`, `retraining_triggers_total`, `model_deploy_time_seconds`, `automation_rate_gauge`, `mttd_seconds`\n\n*Last updated: Session 11 \u2014 KPI governance panels added*",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.2.3",
      "title": "Dashboard Information",
      "type": "text"
